<REGEX>:Binder Error:.*Can't change source type \(BIGINT\) to target type \(STRUCT\(a BIGINT, b BIGINT\)\).*

# a text field of a struct is not the element of a list: the struct is not cast, and the field is a binder error,
# also next to a field that is mapped
statement error
